      "headline": "Saudi Arabia says East-West pipeline hit by drones launched from Iraq",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "“At the request of the Iraqi Prime Minister to allow the brotherly Iraqi government the opportunity to take the necessary measures to prevent attacks launched from Iraqi territory against the Kingdom and neighbouring countries, the Kingdom has chosen not to respond at this stage ",
